Pehla step: agar number 2 ya 3 ho to wo prime hai. Dusra step: agar number even ho ya 1 ho to wo composite hai. Teesra step: 5 se shuru karke sqrt(number) tak odd numbers se divide karo. Agar koi divisor mil jaye to composite, warna prime.
```python
def is_prime(n):
    if n < 2:
        return False
    if n % 2 == 0:
        return n == 2
    i = 3
    while i * i <= n:
        if n % i == 0:
            return False
        i += 2
    return True
```
